  "question": {
    "text": "The reaction of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> with a mixture of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and aqueous <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> gives <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> as the main product. The intermediate not involved in this reaction is (are):",
