  "solution": {
    "text": "This is Hofmann bromamide reaction and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> does not form in this reaction. See mechanism for it:<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/633992_1a.JPG\" /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/633992_5.JPG\" style=\"width: 464px; height: 88px;\" /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/633992_3a.JPG\" style=\"width: 377px; height: 92px;\" /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/633992_4a.JPG\" style